{"job":310,"name":"獵人","stat":[{"t":"弓走向：力量＝等級＋5，其餘全敏（波波）；〈1-50弩寶心得〉作者則寫弓所需力量＝等級＋3。兩說並列，實際以遊戲內武器需求為準。","v":"community","s":["https://bobogameguides.com/maplestory-classic/guides/skills-overview.html","https://bobogameguides.com/maplestory-classic/guides/jobs-overview.html","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/C.php?bsn=85994&snA=1434"]},{"t":"舊版獵人逐級表：10 等力 15／敏 47，20 等力 25／敏 87，30 等力 35／敏 127，40 等力 45／敏 167，50 等力 55／敏 207，60 等力 65／敏 247，70 等力 75／敏 287（智幸 4）。","v":"legacy","s":["https://forum.gamer.com.tw/G2.php?bsn=7650&parent=12537&sn=103","https://bobogameguides.com/maplestory-classic/guides/jobs-overview.html"]},{"t":"舊版〈弓箭手，獵人1至50級心得〉：力量只在換弓時補到該弓需求（34～35 等點到 37 拿火焰之弓／楓葉神弓，54 等前點到 58 拿曹家之弓），其餘全敏。","v":"legacy","s":["https://forum.gamer.com.tw/G2.php?bsn=7650&parent=12537&sn=2997"]}],"builds":[{"label":"主流：炸彈箭主攻、不點終極之弓（強弓＋集中術收尾）","main":true,"v":"community","s":["https://mapleclassictools.com/","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/C.php?bsn=85994&snA=722","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/C.php?bsn=85994&snA=1452","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/C.php?bsn=85994&snA=1433","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/C.php?bsn=85994&snA=1434","https://bobogameguides.com/maplestory-classic/guides/skills-overview.html","https://forum.gamer.com.tw/Co.php?bsn=7650&sn=2681328"],"steps":[{"id":3101005,"name":"炸彈箭","to":1,"note":"拉怪／開範圍技用"},{"id":3100000,"name":"精準之弓","to":19,"note":"19→20 只加 1 命中，先停 19"},{"id":3101002,"name":"快速之弓","to":5},{"id":3101004,"name":"無形之箭","to":5},{"id":3101005,"name":"炸彈箭","to":30},{"id":3101003,"name":"強弓","to":20},{"id":3101002,"name":"快速之弓","to":20},{"id":3101004,"name":"無形之箭","to":20},{"id":3001003,"name":"集中術","to":20,"note":"一轉技能，剩餘 11 點回補"},{"id":3100000,"name":"精準之弓","to":20}]},{"label":"舊板一手・終極之弓路線 分配一","main":false,"v":"legacy","s":["https://forum.gamer.com.tw/G2.php?bsn=7650&parent=12537&sn=103","https://bobogameguides.com/maplestory-classic/guides/skills-overview.html"],"steps":[{"id":3101005,"name":"炸彈箭","to":1},{"id":3100000,"name":"精準之弓","to":19},{"id":3100001,"name":"終極之弓